# Skullclamp: "Whenever equipped creature dies, draw two cards." When Skullclamp and the creature it equips are
# destroyed at the same time, the game looks back at the moment before the event (CR 603.10a): the creature was
# equipped when it died, so the ability triggers even though Skullclamp itself went to the graveyard with it.
#
# Turn 1: Bot1 casts Guerrilla Gorilla and Skullclamp. Turn 3: Bot1 equips the Gorilla (a 3/1) and casts Vicious Rivalry for
# X = 2, destroying every artifact and creature of mana value 2 or less at once: Mox Emerald, Sol Ring, Skullclamp and
# the Gorilla. Bot1 then draws two, so its hand is its turn-3 draw plus both Skullclamp cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Guerrilla Gorilla
Skullclamp
Swamp
Vicious Rivalry
Island
Plains
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skullclamp.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Skullclamp.Activate(Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vicious Rivalry.Cast(X: 2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate

